  mtgPixels:{why:'Structured geostationary FRP points can reduce the observation gap between polar-orbiting satellite passes.',needed:'A registered EUMETCast or LSA SAF MTFRPPIXEL product path, or a governed structured JSON feed.',where:'VIGIA_MTG_FRP_DIR or VIGIA_MTG_FRP_JSON_URL in the service environment.',how:'Route the official point product into the configured path or URL, then restart VIGIA and verify accepted records.',unlocks:'Attributed MTG point observations; raster thermal context alone does not unlock this evidence family.'},
