  observationSchedule:{why:'Known future coverage lets operators distinguish a real upcoming observation from a guessed revisit time.',needed:'A confirmed, attributable observation-opportunity schedule.',where:'data/config/observation-opportunities.json or the file referenced by VIGIA_OBSERVATION_OPPORTUNITY_FILE.',how:'Supply provider or operator-confirmed opportunities; VIGIA will not infer an exact next pass without evidence.',unlocks:'Scheduled observation work, defensible next-opportunity times and overdue coverage tracking.'},
